{"title":"2004 Cyprus MO","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>2004 <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cyprus_Mathematical_Olympiad\" title=\"Cyprus Mathematical Olympiad\">Cyprus MO</a></b> problems and solutions. There are different papers according to the age. Click on each one one to find the problems and solution of each paper.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Cyprus_MO/4th_grade\" title=\"2004 Cyprus MO/4th grade\">2004 Cyprus MO/4th grade</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Cyprus_MO/5th_grade\" title=\"2004 Cyprus MO/5th grade\">2004 Cyprus MO/5th grade</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Cyprus_MO/6th_grade\" title=\"2004 Cyprus MO/6th grade\">2004 Cyprus MO/6th grade</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Cyprus_MO/Gymnasium\" title=\"2004 Cyprus MO/Gymnasium\">2004 Cyprus MO/Gymnasium</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum\" title=\"2004 Cyprus MO/Lyceum\">2004 Cyprus MO/Lyceum</a></li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<hr />\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Cyprus_MO\" title=\"2003 Cyprus MO\">Previous Olympiad</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Cyprus_MO\" title=\"2005 Cyprus MO\">Next Olympiad</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cyprus_MO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"Cyprus MO Problems and Solutions\">Back to the List</a></li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Cyprus_MO&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cyprus_Mathematical_Olympiad\" title=\"Cyprus Mathematical Olympiad\">Cyprus Mathematical Olympiad</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cyprus_MO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=